feat(controller): render raw top tokens — one request per beat

Drop the per-token completeWord fan-out from the initial fetch: tokens
above the probability cutoff render directly (firstWord of the
fragment). The trigger-to-strip path is now a single ~100ms topTokens
request instead of 1 + N requests, to evaluate typing feel. Fragments
may be partial words ("Fr" for "France") — deliberate tradeoff for now;
completeWord stays in llama.ts, unit-tested, in case it returns.

